098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-04-30T23:46:48Z","updated_at":"2025-12-27T02:02:30Z","closed_at":"2025-12-27T02:02:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.stable and 4.5.dev3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev3 - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT (RADV NAVI21) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a .gltf file with a separate .bin is moved within the editor, it becomes invalid because the .bin isn't moved with it:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/698f2827-6bb1-4b13-a408-1b7a6c5f66cb)\n\nNote that:\n1. Godot's file manager hides the .bin, so it's not immediately obvious what went wrong, and they can only be moved together in an external file manager.\n2. Even after you move the .bin to be with the .gltf, the import will still be invalid (even after reloading the project) unless you manually edit the .import to set `valid=true`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In Blender, export a model with the format \"glTF Separate (.gltf + .bin + textures)\" into Godot\n2. In Godot, move the .gltf into a different folder (import breaks)\n3. In an external file manager, move the .bin as well (import is still broken)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19985751/test.zip)\n(after opening, move the Bones.gltf to another folder to reproduce)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105966/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}